==Strategy==
This stage is almost impossible without the proper units, and still extremely difficult with. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] is an absolute must. He has [[Behemoth Slayer]] and [[Massive Damage]] against Red Enemies, so defeating the Capy is easy. Dual Erasers here is also a wonderful addition. Bringing [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] to help with the Dark enemies, though timing is required for getting to Kurocroc. As for the Angels, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N106 (Rare Cat)|Mushroom Cat]] can deal with them relatively easily.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
* [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]] - An absolute unit in this level. As long as you can use the smallest amount of timing, he can destroy the stage. Pair him with Ramen or [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]], and he can demolish everything. A sprinkle of Courier for the Capy, this stage is won.
* [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phonoa]] - Massive Damage to all traits on an all traited stage is absolutely phenomenal. He can nearly solo the stage only of you back him up with good meatshields like Ramen, Nono, Dual Erasers, and Courier.
* [[King of Doom Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Extinction Phono]] - Capable of [[Slow]]ing down all enemies in this stage. The [[Mini-Surge]]s he spawns make this even better, because at high enough levels, they can knock back the doges that may pester him. All around, a great unit for this stage.
* [[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|Urashima Taro]] - Just an amazing tank for the stage. Put him with some Erasers, Courier, and a reliable backliner will make this stage far easier. Him and Kasa Jizo are synergize very well for this stage.

